WEBVTT

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.892
Dark Schneider!

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:20.687
You had better not go dying
on me right now!

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:30.280
Dark Schneider!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.575
The ultimate handsome hero is back

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.410
with an immortal, made-of-steel,

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:39.205
big volcano, big eruption storm,
coming just for you!

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:42.542
Oh yeah. We're gonna do it!

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.502
Thank goodness he's okay!

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:47.380
Dark Schneider.

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:48.798
What the…?

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.677
I can't believe he's still standing
after that last attack.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.596
Ah, shut up!

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:57.724
Of course,
I'd survive a puny attack like that.

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:00.685
Don't make it such a big deal, you fools!

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:05.398
I'm not some impoverished,
groveling commoner, you know?

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.400
I was chosen by the gods.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:10.737
A handsome hero
blessed with dazzling beauty.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:14.866
My power is on a whole different level,
and I will rule the world!

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:23.291
<i>That idiot!</i>

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:26.544
<i>He's acting tough,</i>
<i>but he just took a ton of damage.</i>

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:29.089
<i>He got hit by Exodus.</i>

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:35.261
You can stop pretending
that you're immortal, Dark Schneider.

00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:39.766
It's over for you now.

00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:42.852
You don't have
enough strength left to fight.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:47.899
I will kill you and be one step closer
to building our utopia.

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:52.028
Yeah, right. You don't have what it takes.

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.988
What? You are wrong!

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:58.827
I will kill you!
And I will prove it to you right now!

00:01:59.327 --> 00:02:00.662
Arshes, wait!

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.210
I love you.

00:03:41.596 --> 00:03:46.643
WAVERING

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:47.727
You know I do.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.359
Shut up!

00:03:54.442 --> 00:03:57.070
You fall in love
with any woman you set your eyes on!

00:03:57.153 --> 00:03:58.821
I don't accept your love for me!

00:03:59.822 --> 00:04:01.574
Second Heat spell,

00:04:02.784 --> 00:04:03.743
I command thee!

00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:06.746
Rise from the heavens,
oh spirits of thunder!

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:08.414
Come, Gilbert!

00:04:14.337 --> 00:04:16.130
What are those?

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.132
They're thunder spirits.

00:04:18.716 --> 00:04:21.469
Nei's summoning them
from the wind elemental plane.

00:04:22.345 --> 00:04:25.390
However, summoning spirits
is a double-edged sword.

00:04:25.473 --> 00:04:28.643
If she loses focus, she'll lose control,

00:04:28.726 --> 00:04:31.854
and the spirits will start attacking
the sorcerer who summoned them.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:35.566
Thunder spirits?
What an unusual choice.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.194
Wa quo! Raven!

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:41.406
It's a high-level flight spell!

00:04:41.489 --> 00:04:43.324
Fire spirits!

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:46.619
O eternal flames of darkness,
heed my call!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.579
Tafolla!

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:51.040
Whoa!
Dark Schneider's summoning too!

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.875
They're salamanders.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:53.835
Of course.

00:04:53.918 --> 00:04:58.131
Fire spirits are the only ones
capable of fighting thunder spirits.

00:04:58.214 --> 00:05:02.260
Normally, a sorcerer
can only summon one spirit at a time,

00:05:02.343 --> 00:05:04.887
but these two are strong enough
to control multiple.

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:07.849
They're no ordinary sorcerers.

00:05:07.932 --> 00:05:11.311
Move forward, my spirits of thunder!

00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:21.112
Stop it! Please, Arsh!

00:05:21.195 --> 00:05:23.197
You don't have to do this!

00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:26.159
Shut your mouth!
You can't call me by that name!

00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:31.497
You won't get away!

00:05:31.581 --> 00:05:34.000
What's this utopia you're talking about?

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.376
What a pain.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.087
I get why someone like Kall-Su
would be interested in it,

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:41.341
but can't you see it's just an excuse
for him to conquer the world?

00:05:41.424 --> 00:05:42.508
No. You're wrong!

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:46.095
He's not like you, conquering the world
just to build yourself a harem!

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:50.099
The Sorcerer Kingdom
is the ultimate utopia,

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:51.768
a place where magic rules.

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:54.771
A world without discrimination,
poverty, or war.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:58.858
I'm willing to risk my life
to build a kingdom like that for everyone!

00:05:58.941 --> 00:06:00.526
What a dumb lie!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:04.697
It's absolutely impossible
to create eternal peace here on earth!

00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:09.160
War and hatred are just a part
of what it means to be human!

00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:12.080
A barbarian like you would think that.

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:14.999
You'll never be able
to understand how I feel.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.753
<i>I'm a half-elf</i>
<i>who was born in a time of war.</i>

00:06:18.836 --> 00:06:21.923
<i>Neither the humans</i>
<i>nor the elves would accept me.</i>

00:06:22.006 --> 00:06:24.425
<i>You have no idea how hard it was.</i>

00:06:24.509 --> 00:06:26.010
<i>I was constantly teased!</i>

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:31.641
<i>I was insulted, despised,</i>
<i>hated, and discriminated against.</i>

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:35.228
<i>Ever since I was a child,</i>
<i>my body has been covered in wounds.</i>

00:06:38.022 --> 00:06:41.317
<i>One day,</i>
<i>war broke out amongst the Wood Elves.</i>

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:44.612
<i>The Dark Elves took me in,</i>
<i>and I thought I had a home.</i>

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:48.574
<i>However, eventually they abandoned me.</i>

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:54.038
<i>I didn't understand</i>
<i>what happened.</i>

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:57.417
<i>I wandered around</i>
<i>the burning fields for days,</i>

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.878
<i>but my tribe had long since fled the area.</i>

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.884
They got rid of me
because I was a nuisance.

00:07:07.885 --> 00:07:08.928
<i>Arshes.</i>

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:13.391
But I learned something while starving
in the freezing cold that day.

00:07:13.474 --> 00:07:16.811
Half-elves deserve a place
where they can live in peace!

00:07:20.857 --> 00:07:25.236
And that is why I'm willing
to risk my life to build that utopia!

00:07:26.404 --> 00:07:28.614
Darsh, it's time for you to die!

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:37.373
But, Arsh, how can you forget?

00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.961
<i>How can you forget</i>
<i>that you grabbed onto my robe</i>

00:07:42.044 --> 00:07:43.838
<i>when I was walking by that day?</i>

00:07:46.257 --> 00:07:47.967
And for the next 100 years,

00:07:48.885 --> 00:07:51.554
I gave you a place
where you could live in peace.

00:07:54.849 --> 00:07:56.767
Try to remember, Arshes.

00:07:56.851 --> 00:07:59.479
Remember how things were
when we lived together.

00:07:59.562 --> 00:08:00.730
We were family.

00:08:02.523 --> 00:08:03.816
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.527
<i>Over these past 15 years,</i>

00:08:06.611 --> 00:08:08.279
<i>I've never forgotten.</i>

00:08:08.362 --> 00:08:09.906
<i>Not for a single day.</i>

00:08:11.073 --> 00:08:15.578
<i>And the 100 years before</i>
<i>are all happy memories.</i>

00:08:16.245 --> 00:08:18.331
<i>They were like paradise.</i>

00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:23.211
<i>You didn't have to take me in…</i>

00:08:28.132 --> 00:08:29.425
<i>…but you did.</i>

00:08:31.469 --> 00:08:32.303
Darsh.

00:08:32.803 --> 00:08:33.846
Arsh.

00:08:35.056 --> 00:08:37.225
<i>Darsh.</i> <i>Darsh!</i>

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:55.451
What's wrong?

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.298
No, Arsh.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.761
It is just what I expected to happen.

00:09:13.844 --> 00:09:16.013
Take a look for yourself, Kall-Su.

00:09:16.097 --> 00:09:18.683
Arshes' nail has now turned
from blue to purple.

00:09:20.268 --> 00:09:21.894
That damn half-elf.

00:09:21.978 --> 00:09:25.815
It looks like you still had feelings
for Dark Schneider, after all.

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:27.358
I knew it.

00:09:27.441 --> 00:09:30.444
Well, the next part will be fun to watch.

00:09:31.445 --> 00:09:35.032
The more that Nei opens her heart
to Dark Schneider,

00:09:35.116 --> 00:09:39.036
the more the Accused spell
implanted in her nail will strangle her.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.249
And it won't be long
before the nail turns to a bright crimson.

00:09:43.332 --> 00:09:47.878
Which means, Nei will have completely
betrayed the Four Divine Kings,

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:50.923
<i>and her body will be torn to pieces!</i>

00:09:52.174 --> 00:09:54.719
And then, once the spell takes effect,

00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:58.014
all that will be left of her
is an ugly, little toad.

00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:01.809
Do you not wish to watch?

00:10:01.892 --> 00:10:03.394
There's no reason to.

00:10:04.061 --> 00:10:09.317
If Nei dies, then one of us will have
to defeat Dark Schneider in her stead.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.068
We should prepare for that.

00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:14.405
I'm going to return to my army.

00:10:17.575 --> 00:10:19.035
Hmm.

00:10:20.536 --> 00:10:23.039
That looks quite painful.

00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:26.626
Arshes Nei.

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:29.420
There's only one way to free yourself.

00:10:29.503 --> 00:10:34.300
Dark Schneider must be killed
by ripping his heart out from his chest!

00:10:34.884 --> 00:10:39.180
That's the only way
to break the Accused spell, half-elf!

00:10:46.604 --> 00:10:47.980
Arsh, what's wrong?

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:55.279
And here I was
about to fall for your tricks again.

00:10:55.863 --> 00:10:56.739
Nei?

00:10:56.822 --> 00:10:59.408
You must have
fooled hundreds of women by now,

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:02.912
and used them as tools
to satisfy your own ambition!

00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:10.878
<i>The salamanders are acting strangely.</i>

00:11:10.961 --> 00:11:14.215
<i>Dark Schneider's</i>
<i>mental focus must be getting weaker.</i>

00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:17.843
He's holding on,

00:11:17.927 --> 00:11:20.221
but if he takes any more damage,
he won't make it.

00:11:20.304 --> 00:11:23.057
Now it's time
to send you to your grave.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.267
Wolf Fang Thunder Blast!

00:11:29.605 --> 00:11:32.191
He's taking too much damage to survive!

00:11:35.277 --> 00:11:36.570
No, Lucien!

00:11:43.869 --> 00:11:47.081
You are my enemy
and not my family anymore!

00:11:54.296 --> 00:11:58.175
<i>Whenever we had a fight,</i>
<i>you'd say that to me.</i>

00:12:00.094 --> 00:12:02.054
I'm so sorry, Darsh.

00:12:02.138 --> 00:12:05.599
I know that it was my fault.
Please, don't hate me.

00:12:06.183 --> 00:12:08.811
Come on. There's no need to cry.

00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:10.187
You know I love you.

00:12:10.271 --> 00:12:11.856
Are you sure you do?

00:12:11.939 --> 00:12:13.315
Of course, I do.

00:12:15.651 --> 00:12:17.987
<i>First, you'd say,</i>
<i>"You're not my daughter,"</i>

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.030
<i>then you'd say, "I love you."</i>

00:12:21.031 --> 00:12:22.908
<i>It was always the same.</i>

00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:24.493
<i>Whatever suited you.</i>

00:12:28.247 --> 00:12:29.415
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:12:29.498 --> 00:12:33.377
<i>To you, I was just some half-elf girl</i>
<i>you decided to take in.</i>

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.756
<i>But… but to me…</i>

00:12:37.256 --> 00:12:40.176
<i>Do you have any idea</i>
<i>how important you were to me?</i>

00:12:42.094 --> 00:12:45.931
I will not accept surrender
from anyone who clashes with my blade.

00:12:46.015 --> 00:12:47.683
You will lose to me, Darsh.

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:50.728
And then,
I'll cut you into tiny, little pieces!

00:12:52.688 --> 00:12:55.566
<i> You were like my father,</i>
<i>and you were my lover,</i>

00:12:55.649 --> 00:12:57.526
<i>but it's more than just that.</i>

00:12:58.027 --> 00:13:02.615
<i>You were the only one…</i>
<i>the only one I had to hold on to.</i>

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:06.243
<i>To me,</i>
<i>you were everything I knew about love!</i>

00:13:06.744 --> 00:13:09.830
<i>But now, please just die already!</i>

00:13:15.586 --> 00:13:16.545
But why?

00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:20.299
<i>Why do you keep getting up?</i>

00:13:21.842 --> 00:13:23.886
<i>Why, Darsh?</i>

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.520
<i>It's weird.</i>

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.148
<i>Here aura doesn't seem evil anymore.</i>

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:40.194
<i>I'm sensing something else.</i>

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:43.739
A<i> crying child.</i>

00:13:47.451 --> 00:13:49.078
Yeah. Something's changed.

00:13:49.161 --> 00:13:51.455
Why are the spirits
going out of control?

00:13:51.539 --> 00:13:54.750
<i>Has Nei lost control</i>
<i>of the thunder spirits?</i>

00:14:00.172 --> 00:14:01.090
Watch out, girl!

00:14:01.173 --> 00:14:02.675
Yoko! Yoko!

00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:03.759
Huh?

00:14:06.804 --> 00:14:09.890
Watch out, Yoko!

00:14:15.104 --> 00:14:16.647
No. Yoko.

00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:19.608
<i>Yoko.</i>

00:14:24.905 --> 00:14:26.490
Whoa! That was close!

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:28.158
You got pretty lucky that time.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.539
I wouldn't go down that easy.

00:14:33.622 --> 00:14:35.583
Come on. I'm too young to die.

00:14:37.918 --> 00:14:41.088
Princess Sheila!
Are you okay? Say something!

00:14:43.173 --> 00:14:46.552
Oh, good. I guess she just passed out.

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:48.554
Oh no.

00:14:48.637 --> 00:14:49.805
They're attacking.

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:52.683
The spirits are going
after Dark Schneider and Nei!

00:14:57.938 --> 00:14:58.772
<i>No.</i>

00:15:00.858 --> 00:15:02.067
<i>I'm horrible.</i>

00:15:06.155 --> 00:15:07.239
<i>I…</i>

00:15:12.369 --> 00:15:15.122
It's done, Dark Schneider.

00:15:15.706 --> 00:15:18.334
I'm going to end this with my next spell.

00:15:19.376 --> 00:15:22.922
You've only got enough strength left
for one more attack.

00:15:23.714 --> 00:15:25.299
So give it your all.

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.927
And if you can't beat me,

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.846
your woman is going to die next!

00:15:31.972 --> 00:15:33.557
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

00:15:33.641 --> 00:15:37.853
<i>When the thunder spirits attacked Yoko,</i>
<i>they were already free from Nei's control.</i>

00:15:38.354 --> 00:15:40.564
<i>So what is she trying to do?</i>

00:15:42.191 --> 00:15:43.275
<i>I knew it. </i>

00:15:43.776 --> 00:15:46.528
<i>There's something weird going on with her.</i>

00:15:46.612 --> 00:15:50.783
<i>It doesn't look like</i>
<i>she's trying to kill Lucien.</i>

00:15:53.035 --> 00:15:55.496
I can't let you hurt Yoko.

00:15:55.996 --> 00:15:59.166
I won't forgive anyone
who tries to hurt her.

00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:02.211
So let's fight!

00:16:07.174 --> 00:16:10.928
Well then,
you really must hurry, Arshes Nei.

00:16:11.011 --> 00:16:14.431
Otherwise, the nail
will destroy you once it turns red!

00:16:15.182 --> 00:16:19.895
Rip out Dark Schneider's heart
and use his blood to break the spell!

00:16:20.562 --> 00:16:22.815
If you want to live!

00:16:29.279 --> 00:16:31.323
It's time to start, Dark Schneider!

00:16:31.407 --> 00:16:35.411
This destruction spell will be the one
to end you once and for all!

00:16:35.494 --> 00:16:37.162
Go ahead and try it!

00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:40.874
I'm going to fight back with
the most powerful spell I've ever used.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:48.048
Whoa! It's already begun!

00:16:48.132 --> 00:16:50.092
We won't make it.

00:16:50.175 --> 00:16:53.762
Damn! The two of them
are using such powerful magic down there.

00:16:53.846 --> 00:16:56.682
At this rate, they're going
to end up killing each other!

00:16:56.765 --> 00:16:57.641
No.

00:16:57.725 --> 00:17:01.395
When I saw Dark Schneider
in my vision, he was a corpse.

00:17:01.478 --> 00:17:04.857
His heart had been ripped out his chest.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:08.569
The outcome of this battle
has already been decided.

00:17:10.904 --> 00:17:12.448
<i>The storm is ending.</i>

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:24.960
Here goes. The two of them
are about to cast their spells!

00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:29.965
Kiske, hansen, grosskopf, sielck…

00:17:30.549 --> 00:17:33.302
No way! They're casting the same spell!

00:17:33.385 --> 00:17:37.806
Right now, Dark Schneider's spell
is not yet complete!

00:17:38.932 --> 00:17:42.644
Turn my enemies to ashes,
O sage of Hades.

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:45.439
Open the gates of Hell
with the seven keys!

00:17:47.191 --> 00:17:50.235
<i>That's impossible!</i>
<i>How could Nei learn this?</i>

00:17:50.319 --> 00:17:52.446
<i>The ultimate spell of destruction!</i>

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:57.451
Helloween!

00:18:02.998 --> 00:18:05.501
<i>Goodbye, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:18:07.211 --> 00:18:08.253
<i>I love you.</i>

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:14.593
Lucien!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.929
They're locked in battle!

00:18:17.429 --> 00:18:19.848
It's… it's an even match!

00:18:19.932 --> 00:18:22.017
No. It's not. Take a closer look.

00:18:23.519 --> 00:18:25.521
The rocks
behind Nei are cracking!

00:18:25.604 --> 00:18:27.147
Nei's getting pushed back!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.984
Dark Schneider's spell
does seem to be overpowering her.

00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:35.656
But the Helloween spell isn't meant
to be released for such a long time.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.742
This will only last a few more seconds.

00:18:38.826 --> 00:18:40.619
The magical force is building up!

00:18:40.702 --> 00:18:42.246
It's going to blow Nei away!

00:18:52.881 --> 00:18:54.007
<i>Hurry.</i>

00:18:54.091 --> 00:18:55.134
<i>Please,</i>

00:18:55.759 --> 00:19:00.973
<i>put an end to this before this curse</i>
<i>transforms me into a toad.</i>

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:03.934
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:19:06.019 --> 00:19:09.189
<i>It looks like she's crying.</i>

00:19:09.273 --> 00:19:12.359
The battle is about to be decided.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.279
<i>She's crying for him.</i>

00:19:15.779 --> 00:19:18.073
<i>It doesn't matter that she's adopted,</i>

00:19:18.157 --> 00:19:21.493
<i>it's wrong for a parent</i>
<i>and a child to fight to the death!</i>

00:19:21.577 --> 00:19:23.954
We have to stop this madness!

00:19:24.037 --> 00:19:25.706
Gara, can't you do something?

00:19:25.789 --> 00:19:26.999
Impossible!

00:19:27.082 --> 00:19:29.459
It would be insane
to try and stop them now!

00:19:29.543 --> 00:19:32.546
They're locked in a trance
while they're casting the spell!

00:19:32.629 --> 00:19:34.631
There's nothing we can do!

00:19:34.715 --> 00:19:37.009
Once a sorcerer casts a spell,

00:19:37.092 --> 00:19:39.178
the energy has to go somewhere!

00:19:41.221 --> 00:19:45.017
Once it's begun to release,
there's no way anyone can reverse it!

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:46.643
No way.

00:19:47.519 --> 00:19:48.687
Lucien!

00:19:50.105 --> 00:19:51.732
She won't last.

00:19:52.232 --> 00:19:54.985
This is the Empress of Thunder's
last moment.

00:20:01.283 --> 00:20:02.659
<i>Once I die,</i>

00:20:02.743 --> 00:20:06.663
<i>I beg you, please,</i>
<i>hold me one last time,</i>

00:20:07.164 --> 00:20:08.040
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:11.418
Dark Schneider.

00:20:12.002 --> 00:20:14.880
What's that? I can hear a voice.

00:20:17.925 --> 00:20:18.967
Who's this?

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:22.596
Are you Lucien Renlen?

00:20:23.305 --> 00:20:24.765
Dark Schneider.

00:20:25.349 --> 00:20:29.228
Can't you tell
she's suffering a pain worse than death?

00:20:29.311 --> 00:20:33.899
Don't you see that Arshes is doing this
because she loves you so much.

00:20:34.399 --> 00:20:35.692
Open you eyes.

00:20:35.776 --> 00:20:38.362
And take a good look
at your precious daughter.

00:20:39.529 --> 00:20:40.697
What did you say?

00:20:43.784 --> 00:20:44.618
It's…

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:49.831
…Accused!

00:20:50.791 --> 00:20:51.750
You see?

00:20:51.833 --> 00:20:55.796
Nei doesn't want to die by the curse,
nor does she want to kill you.

00:20:55.879 --> 00:20:58.966
She wishes to die
by the hand of the one she loves.

00:20:59.049 --> 00:21:01.218
<i>There's no way!</i>

00:21:01.301 --> 00:21:03.845
<i>Abigail, that son of a bitch!</i>

00:21:03.929 --> 00:21:05.097
<i>Darsh.</i>

00:21:05.931 --> 00:21:06.890
<i>I love you.</i>

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:08.558
<i>I love you.</i>

00:21:09.851 --> 00:21:10.978
<i>I love you.</i>

00:21:13.855 --> 00:21:14.940
<i>I love you.</i>

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.989
Abigail did this!

00:21:23.323 --> 00:21:25.659
You asshole! How could you?

00:21:25.742 --> 00:21:28.745
What did you do to my sweet Arshes?

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:51.703
The Helloween spell
is disappearing.

00:22:52.287 --> 00:22:54.164
There's no way.

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:56.291
Lucien.

00:22:57.209 --> 00:23:00.212
I see. Transfer magic.

00:23:00.295 --> 00:23:03.215
He sent
the Helloween spell somewhere else.

00:23:10.138 --> 00:23:10.972
I…

00:23:11.765 --> 00:23:12.933
But why?

00:23:16.353 --> 00:23:17.604
Why, Darsh.

00:23:19.648 --> 00:23:21.525
Does it hurt, Arsh?

00:23:23.402 --> 00:23:25.695
I will set you free from it.
